## Project Structure

```
portfolio/
├── main.py                     # FastAPI app entry point
├── README.md
├── requirements.txt
├── .gitignore
├── routers/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── pages.py                # Page routes, profile data, PROJECTS list
│   └── api.py                  # API endpoints (e.g. AI outreach email drafting)
├── templates/
│   ├── base.html
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── projects.html           # Project cards (built from PROJECTS in pages.py)
│   ├── project.html            # ? single project page
│   ├── lab.html                # Live Lab: SQL, segmentation, lead scoring, movies
│   └── lead_scorer.html        # Lead Scorer page embedding the Hugging Face demo
└── static/
    ├── main.js
    ├── style.css
    ├── css/
    │   └── lab.css             # Live Lab styles
    ├── js/
    │   ├── project-links.js    # Links project cards to their live demos
    │   ├── lab-rfm.js          # Customer segmentation demo
    │   ├── lab-leads.js        # In-browser lead scoring demo
    │   ├── lab.movies.js       # Movie recommender demo
    │   └── movies.js           # ? movie data
    ├── data/                   # Datasets used by the Live Lab demos
    └── images/
```

## Run locally

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

Open `http://127.0.0.1:8000`.

## Live demos

- **Lead Scorer:** a Gradient Boosting model hosted on Hugging Face Spaces and embedded at `/projects/lead-scorer`.
- **Live Lab (`/lab`):** SQL playground, customer segmentation (RFM and K-Means), lead scoring and movie recommender, all running in the browser.
